210893_1083918439466943_4096975780482072563_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Dv22Xq0IjQQ7kNvwEJaUk0&_nc_oc=Adlo5ulwrdDbHhskyGXXhziX5eorDivh5aC7q4-C8Qoy9qrKd_aCwAvYgZZh5jQfVg8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxiYjnFE-DwU8WBtttF9QfiD7ejLXJN76ZP3J1zWVn2Rw&oe=69AC18EE"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1441316176805782", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_1441316180139115_660872075344180481_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gUdF2M9aXvYQ7kNvwFlw7qo&_nc_oc=AdmJiSRHZD-_kSogVwr03p4u3G4J47sk6Q3BB29TbAVKq3T4DV_eGytFsM62ONQVyFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxo3U8ZE36kpEgJOM_g-huR_1PPjjlqPmFW2Tv6uANViw&oe=69AC088D"}, {"file_name": "8.png", "id": "1052888042643074", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001670_1052888055976406_3539002532750634157_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=82JnR6F9QUQQ7kNvwE2wXbX&_nc_oc=Adk_G8QQ4i35gfX7YIRkrUW98n-gLhgA2L0YknjVaFLLm5YKaoDUq-pzk8Lcb7oUjyE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwxt9EHM-GhOTR7t7UWgFnToIrymmNXr5RMmLKbLoop2Q&oe=69AC0428"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "2276308399239936", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982626_2276308402573269_1803063043453586688_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dTXvghPJJMEQ7kNvwHIWaXd&_nc_oc=AdkgpvbqWGW--C7mFBiTsqHYJO3gzkp2VZXg9vdpjTqPZJ35rCd33CyIU9TgMxlw-u4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw57mPfMMb0WXgWC1Yxjj5UNCZE5DnSiweyg_C1I4lttA&oe=69AC14B3"}, "display_name": "Last Chance: The Survivor", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"Last Chance: The Survivor\" is a VR-based action-shooter game that chronicles the gripping journey of Gabriel, starting as a scientist in an army laboratory and continuing as a father searching for his daughter in a post-apocalyptic world. Following a devastating catastrophe that has ravaged the world, Gabriel focuses on one sole purpose in his ruined life: finding his lost daughter. During this journey, Gabriel faces the challenges of a broken world, enduring both physical and emotional battles.\n\nFeatures:\n\nRealistic VR Experience:\nHigh-quality graphics and fluid VR mechanics for an immersive post-apocalyptic experience. Interact naturally with a world full of interactive objects and realistic physics.\n\nStrategic Combat:\nDiverse weapons for varied strategies. Defeat enemies using environmental tactics and smart resource management.\n\nDiverse Zombies:\nFace different types of zombies, each requiring unique combat approaches. From swift attackers to more formidable foes, adapt your strategy to survive.\n\nHighscore Mode:\nEndless action in Highscore Mode. Aim for high scores against increasing zombie waves. Tests shooting skills, quick thinking, and agility.\n\nVersions: \n1.0.3 - 'Highscore' and 'Training' modes are currently playable. New modes coming soon! Thanks for your feedback and support! ", "short_description": "Last Chance: The Survivor is a VR-based action-shooter game that chronicles the gripping journey of Gabriel, starting as a scientist in an army laboratory and continuing as a father searching for his daughter in a post-apocalyptic world. Following a devastating catastrophe that has ravaged the world, Gabriel focuses on one sole purpose in his ruined life: finding his lost daughter. During this journey, Gabriel faces the challenges of a broken world, enduring both physical and emotional battles."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.lastchancevr.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.lastchancevr.com/eula", "publisher_name": "Tickinteractive Technology", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.lastchancevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "27433260359255